  "about": [
    "Hey there ,",
    "I’m a product designer focused on web applications and AI-native products. I’ve spent the last 3+ years working with early-stage teams, getting involved from the very beginning from shaping the brand and product direction to designing the UX, building systems, and products ready to ship.",
    "Working closely with small teams has taught me to adapt quickly , question the idea itself, and move between strategy, design, and prototyping as needed.  My focus is always the same: help teams ship faster and build products that last.",
    "Outside of work, I cook, hunt for good food, fall into random AI rabbit holes, and rewatch The Big Bang Theory more than I’d like to admit."
  ]
